    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105231" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρί-σκαλμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with three tholepins,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκάφη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
					25.5
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλοῖον οὐδὲν αὐτοῖς τρισκάλμου μεῖζον
					ἀπέλιπε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Aem.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. ϝᾶες</span> are 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριήρεις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				679
			</span></i> (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				1074
			</span></i> (lyr.).</div>
